## Cleaning (1)

#renaming variables

census:

```{r}
census_clean <- census_raw |>
  rename(
    category = `Label (Grouping)`,
    total = `Montgomery County, Maryland!!Total!!Estimate`,
    below_poverty = `Montgomery County, Maryland!!Below poverty level!!Estimate`,
    poverty_percent = `Montgomery County, Maryland!!Percent below poverty level!!Estimate`
  )
```


```{r}
census_clean <- census_clean |>
  filter(!is.na(poverty_percent))
```

```{r}
census_clean <- census_clean |>
  mutate(
    poverty_percent = as.numeric(gsub("%", "", poverty_percent))
  )
```




```{r}
census_clean <- census |> 
  rename(
    poverty_rate = `Montgomery County, Maryland!!Percent below poverty level!!Estimate`,
    demographic = `Label (Grouping)`)
```






